OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after vulnerable man
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspect has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fvulnerable man was seriously injured in
OL,8,Fa stabbing on a street in Nottingham.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to an incident outside a shop in
OL,12,FRadford Road at 12.40 BST on Thursday.
OL,14,FThe victim, a man in his 40s, was found
OL,15,Fwith a stab wound and was taken to
OL,16,Fhospital for treatment for injuries
OL,17,Fdescribed as serious but not
OL,18,Flife-threatening.
OL,20,FA 35-year-old man was arrested in
OL,21,FBulwell on suspicion of wounding with
OL,22,Fintent and remains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
